sequenceDiagram
    participant Pipeline as Data Science Pipelines<br/>(gRPC Client)
    participant UI as Pipeline UI / Client
    participant MLMD as metadata_store_server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC/HTTP-2
    participant DB as MySQL/PostgreSQL<br/>3306 or 5432/TCP

    note over MLMD,DB: Flow 3: Startup & Schema Initialization
    MLMD->>DB: Connect & initialize schema<br/>Database protocol, Optional SSL<br/>Auth: Username/password
    DB-->>MLMD: Schema ready
    note over MLMD: gRPC listener starts<br/>8080/TCP, Optional TLS

    note over Pipeline,DB: Flow 1: ML Pipeline Metadata Recording
    Pipeline->>MLMD: PutExecution / PutArtifacts / PutEvents<br/>gRPC/HTTP-2, Optional TLS<br/>Auth: Optional mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE metadata<br/>Database protocol, Optional SSL<br/>Auth: Username/password
    DB-->>MLMD: Rows affected
    MLMD-->>Pipeline: PutResponse (IDs assigned)

    note over UI,DB: Flow 2: Lineage Query
    UI->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph<br/>gRPC/HTTP-2, Optional TLS<br/>Auth: Optional mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: SELECT lineage graph<br/>Database protocol, Optional SSL<br/>Auth: Username/password
    DB-->>MLMD: Result set
    MLMD-->>UI: LineageSubgraph response<br/>gRPC/HTTP-2, Optional TLS
